{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "TheAtticAI - Promptfoo API Documentation",
    "description": "# Welcome to Promptfoo API\n\nThis documentation helps you understand and use the Promptfoo API for both **Self-Hosted** and **Enterprise** versions.\n\n## 🏗️ Two Access Options\n\n### ✅ **Self-Hosted (TheAtticAI)**\n- **Server:** `https://promptfoo.theattic.ai`\n- **Authentication:** IP Whitelisting only\n- **Available Features:**\n  - Check system health\n  - View test results\n  - Upload results from CLI\n\n### 🔴 **Enterprise Cloud**\n- **Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n- **Authentication:** API Key required\n- **Available Features:**\n  - Manage teams and users\n  - Configure roles and permissions\n  - Set up red team testing\n  - Configure adaptive guardrails\n  - Set up webhooks\n  - View and manage results with team controls\n\n## 🌐 For Non-Enterprise Users\n\nIf you don't have an Enterprise account, you have two options:\n\n**Option 1: Use the Web UI**\n- Visit [Promptfoo Hosted - TheAtticAI](https://promptfoo.theattic.ai/) to access the web interface\n- View your test results and reports directly in the browser\n\n**Option 2: Request CLI Access**\n- Contact TheAttic Team to request CLI authentication credentials\n- This allows you to use Promptfoo from your command line\n\n## 📚 Complete API Reference\n\nFor the complete list of all available APIs and detailed documentation, please visit:\n[Promptfoo API Doc](https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/api-reference/)\n\nThis documentation provides a summary of the most commonly used endpoints. For advanced features, detailed examples, and the latest updates, please refer to the official documentation.\n\n\n## 📖 Helpful Links\n- [Enterprise API Guide](https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/api-reference/)\n- [Teams Setup](https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/enterprise/teams/)\n- [Self-Hosting Guide](https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/usage/self-hosting/)\n- [Red Teaming Guide](https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/red-team/)\n- [Guardrails Guide](https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/red-team/guardrails/)",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Promptfoo Support",
      "url": "https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": ""
    },
    "x-jentic-source-url": "https://api.swaggerhub.com/apis/theatticai/Promptfo-API/1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://promptfoo.theattic.ai",
      "description": "✅ Self-Hosted Server (TheAtticAI)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app",
      "description": "🔴 Enterprise Cloud Server"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "✅ Self-Hosted: Health",
      "description": "Check system health and status"
    },
    {
      "name": "✅ Self-Hosted: Results",
      "description": "View and manage test results"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Authentication",
      "description": "User authentication and session management"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Teams",
      "description": "Complete team management"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Users",
      "description": "User management and invitations"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Red Team Plugins",
      "description": "Manage red team testing plugins"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Red Team Configs",
      "description": "Manage red team configurations"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Custom Policies",
      "description": "Create and manage custom security policies"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Guardrails",
      "description": "Real-time protection API"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔴 Enterprise: Results",
      "description": "View and manage results with team access controls"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "✅ Self-Hosted: Health"
        ],
        "summary": "Health Check",
        "description": "## ✅ AVAILABLE ON SELF-HOSTED\n\nCheck if the Promptfoo server is running and responsive.\n\n**Server:** `https://promptfoo.theattic.ai`\n\n**Authentication:** None \n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\ncurl https://promptfoo.theattic.ai/api/health\n```",
        "operationId": "healthCheck",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://promptfoo.theattic.ai"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Server is healthy",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": "ok"
                    },
                    "version": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": "0.119.6"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/results": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "✅ Self-Hosted: Results"
        ],
        "summary": "List Results",
        "description": "## ✅ AVAILABLE ON SELF-HOSTED\n\nGet list of all test results.\n\n**Server:** `https://promptfoo.theattic.ai`\n\n**Authentication:** None \n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\ncurl https://promptfoo.theattic.ai/api/results?limit=50&offset=0\n```",
        "operationId": "listResults",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://promptfoo.theattic.ai"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 50
            },
            "description": "Maximum number of results to return"
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 0
            },
            "description": "Number of results to skip for pagination"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of results",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvaluationResult"
                      }
                    },
                    "total": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "limit": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "offset": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/results/{resultId}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "✅ Self-Hosted: Results"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Result Details",
        "description": "## ✅ AVAILABLE ON SELF-HOSTED\n\nGet detailed information about a specific test result.\n\n**Server:** `https://promptfoo.theattic.ai`\n\n**Authentication:** None \n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\ncurl https://promptfoo.theattic.ai/api/results/eval_abc123\n```\n\n**What you get:**\n- Complete test results and metrics\n- Success/failure counts\n- Individual test case details\n- Configuration used\n- Execution metadata (duration, model, provider)",
        "operationId": "getSelfHostedResult",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://promptfoo.theattic.ai"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "resultId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "eval_abc123",
            "description": "Test result ID"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Result details",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvaluationDetail"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Result not found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/auth/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Authentication"
        ],
        "summary": "Login",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nLogin to Enterprise Cloud API with your API key.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key\n\n**How to get your API key:**\n1. Log into https://your-company.promptfoo.app\n2. Go to your Profile\n3. Click \"CLI Login Information\"\n4. Copy your API key\n\n**Reference:** https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/api-reference/",
        "operationId": "enterpriseLogin",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "apiKey"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "apiKey": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "pfoo_abc123"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Login successful"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/teams": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "List All Teams",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nGet list of all teams in your organization.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Reference:** https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/api-reference/#tag/teams\n\n**CLI Alternative:**\n```bash\npromptfoo auth teams list\n```",
        "operationId": "listTeams",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of teams",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Team"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Create Team",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nCreate a new team in your organization.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Reference:** https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/api-reference/#tag/teams/POST/api/v1/teams\n\n**Permissions Required:** Organization Admin",
        "operationId": "createTeam",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "name",
                  "organizationId"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "Engineering Team"
                  },
                  "organizationId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "org_xyz789"
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "AI Engineering and Security Testing"
                  },
                  "slug": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "engineering"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Team created successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Team"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/teams/{teamId}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Team Details",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nGet detailed information about a specific team.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)",
        "operationId": "getTeam",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "team_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Team details",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Team"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Update Team",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nUpdate team information.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Permissions Required:** Team Admin or Organization Admin",
        "operationId": "updateTeam",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Team updated successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Team"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete Team",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nDelete a team from your organization.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Permissions Required:** Organization Admin\n\n**Warning:** This action cannot be undone. All team data will be permanently deleted.",
        "operationId": "deleteTeam",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Team deleted successfully"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/teams/{teamId}/members": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "List Team Members",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nGet list of all members in a team.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)",
        "operationId": "listTeamMembers",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of team members",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TeamMember"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Add Team Member",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nAdd a user to a team or update their role.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Permissions Required:** Team Admin or Organization Admin\n\n**Note:** If the user is not in the organization, they will receive an invitation email.",
        "operationId": "addTeamMember",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "userId"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "userId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "user_def456"
                  },
                  "roleId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "member",
                    "enum": [
                      "admin",
                      "member",
                      "viewer"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Member added successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TeamMember"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/teams/{teamId}/members/{userId}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Team Member",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nGet details of a specific team member.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)",
        "operationId": "getTeamMember",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "userId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Team member details",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TeamMember"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Update Team Member Role",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nUpdate a team member's role.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Permissions Required:** Team Admin or Organization Admin",
        "operationId": "updateTeamMember",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "userId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "roleId"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "roleId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "admin",
                      "member",
                      "viewer"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Member role updated",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TeamMember"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Teams"
        ],
        "summary": "Remove Team Member",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nRemove a user from a team.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Permissions Required:** Team Admin or Organization Admin\n\n**Note:** This only removes the user from the team, not from the organization.",
        "operationId": "removeTeamMember",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "teamId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "userId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Member removed successfully"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/users": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Users"
        ],
        "summary": "List All Users",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nGet list of all users in your organization.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Reference:** https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/api-reference/#tag/users\n\n**Permissions Required:** Organization Admin or Team Admin",
        "operationId": "listUsers",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 50
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "active",
                "pending",
                "inactive"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of users",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                      }
                    },
                    "total": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "limit": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "offset": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Users"
        ],
        "summary": "Invite User",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nInvite a new user to your organization.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**Reference:** https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/api-reference/#tag/users\n\n**Permissions Required:** Organization Admin\n\n**Note:** User will receive an invitation email. They must accept to join.",
        "operationId": "inviteUser",
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "https://api.promptfoo.app"
          }
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "email"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "email": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "email"
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "role": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "admin",
                      "member",
                      "viewer"
                    ],
                    "default": "member"
                  },
                  "teams": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "description": "Team IDs to add user to"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "User invited successfully",
