    "/api/v1/redteam/plugins": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "🔴 Enterprise: Red Team Plugins"
        ],
        "summary": "List Red Team Plugins",
        "description": "# 🔴 ENTERPRISE ONLY\n\nGet list of all available red team testing plugins.\n\n**Server:** `https://api.promptfoo.app`\n\n**Authentication:** API Key (required)\n\n**What are plugins?**\nPlugins are tools that generate different types of security tests:\n- Testing for harmful content\n- Testing for prompt injection\n- Testing for jailbreaks\n- Testing for data leaks\n- Testing for PII exposure\n- And many more\n\n**Reference:** https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/red-team/plugins/",
